      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">♻️</div>
        <h3>Zero Waste Cafe</h3>
        <p>Compostable packaging, reusable cups, and our spent grounds upcycled into garden fertilizer — waste-free from start to finish.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# MENU #}
