        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="menu-item">
        <div class="menu-img">🍰</div>
        <div class="menu-info">
          <h4>Banana Loaf</h4>
          <p>Moist organic banana bread, slice or whole</p>
          <div class="menu-price"><span class="price">₱110</span><span class="eco-badge">🌿 Eco</span></div>
